{% comment %}
  WANDER STATE - Homepage Sections for Shopify

  These sections should be added to your Shopify theme.
  Go to: Online Store > Themes > Customize > Add Section

  For custom sections, you may need to create new section files
  in your theme's /sections folder.
{% endcomment %}


{%- comment -%}
=====================================
SECTION 1: HERO BANNER
=====================================
Add this as an "Image Banner" or custom "Hero" section
{%- endcomment -%}

<section class="ws-hero" style="background-image: url('{{ 'hero-mountain-background.jpg' | asset_url }}');">
  <div class="ws-hero__content">
    <h1 class="ws-hero__title">WANDER STATE</h1>
    <p class="ws-hero__subtitle">Nourish Your Journey</p>
    <p class="ws-hero__description">
      Functional Sparkling Teas powered by mushrooms and pure maple water.<br>
      Stay curious. Explore. Connect.
    </p>
    <div class="ws-hero__buttons">
      <a href="/collections/all" class="button button--primary">Explore Our Teas</a>
      <a href="/pages/our-story" class="button button--tertiary">Learn More</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


{%- comment -%}
=====================================
SECTION 2: FEATURED PRODUCTS
=====================================
Use Shopify's built-in "Featured Collection" section
Configure with these settings:
- Collection: All Products (or create "Featured" collection)
- Heading: "Our Functional Sparkling Teas"
- Description: "Four unique flavors designed to support your adventures, from morning clarity to evening relaxation."
- Products to show: 4
- Columns desktop: 4
- Enable quick add: Yes
{%- endcomment -%}

{% comment %} Custom product grid if needed {% endcomment %}
<section class="ws-py-4xl" style="background: var(--ws-cream);">
  <div class="ws-container ws-text-center">
    <h2 class="ws-mb-md">Our Functional Sparkling Teas</h2>
    <p class="ws-mb-2xl" style="max-width: 700px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; color: var(--ws-medium-gray);">
      Four unique flavors designed to support your adventures, from morning clarity to evening relaxation.
    </p>

    <div class="ws-feature-grid" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);">
      {% for product in collections['all'].products limit: 4 %}
        <a href="{{ product.url }}" class="ws-feature-card" style="text-decoration: none;">
          <img src="{{ product.featured_image | img_url: '300x300' }}" alt="{{ product.title }}" style="max-width: 150px; margin: 0 auto var(--ws-space-md);">
          <h3 class="ws-feature-card__title">{{ product.title }}</h3>
          <p class="ws-feature-card__text">{{ product.metafields.custom.tagline | default: product.description | truncate: 60 }}</p>
          <span class="button button--tertiary" style="margin-top: var(--ws-space-md);">Learn More</span>
        </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


{%- comment -%}
=====================================
SECTION 3: CONTENT BLOCK - "Wander with Purpose"
=====================================
Use "Image with Text" section or create custom
{%- endcomment -%}

<section class="ws-py-3xl" style="background: var(--ws-cream);">
  <div class="ws-container">
    <div class="ws-content-block">
      <div class="ws-content-block__image" style="background-image: url('{{ 'lifestyle-outdoor.jpg' | asset_url }}'); min-height: 400px;">
      </div>
      <div class="ws-content-block__text ws-content-block__text--dark">
        <h3>Wander with Purpose</h3>
        <p>
          Every can supports the trails, forests, and wild places that inspire us.
          Fuel your next adventure with functional mushrooms and real ingredients.
        </p>
        <a href="/pages/where-we-wander" class="button button--tertiary" style="align-self: flex-start;">Where We Wander</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


{%- comment -%}
=====================================
SECTION 4: MUSHROOM SCIENCE BANNER
=====================================
Use "Image Banner" with text overlay or custom section
{%- endcomment -%}

<section class="ws-section-dark ws-py-4xl ws-text-center">
  <div class="ws-container">
    <h2 class="ws-mb-md">Powered by Functional Mushrooms</h2>
    <p class="ws-mb-xl" style="max-width: 700px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; opacity: 0.9;">
      Each can is packed with Lion's Mane, Reishi, and Cordyceps — full-spectrum mushrooms grown and tested in the U.S.
    </p>
    <a href="/pages/mushroom-science" class="button button--tertiary">Learn the Science</a>
  </div>
</section>


{%- comment -%}
=====================================
SECTION 5: MEET YOUR MUSHROOMS
=====================================
Use "Multicolumn" section or create custom
{%- endcomment -%}

<section class="ws-py-4xl" style="background: var(--ws-white);">
  <div class="ws-container ws-text-center">
    <h2 class="ws-mb-md">Meet Your Mushrooms</h2>
    <p class="ws-mb-2xl" style="max-width: 600px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; color: var(--ws-medium-gray);">
      Three powerful functional mushrooms, each with unique benefits.
    </p>

    <div class="ws-feature-grid">
      <div class="ws-feature-card">
        <img src="{{ 'mushroom-lions-mane.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Lion's Mane Mushroom" class="ws-feature-card__icon" style="width: 80px; height: 80px;">
        <h4 class="ws-feature-card__title">Lion's Mane</h4>
        <p class="ws-feature-card__text">Supports cognitive function, focus, and mental clarity. Known as the "smart mushroom."</p>
      </div>

      <div class="ws-feature-card">
        <img src="{{ 'mushroom-reishi.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Reishi Mushroom" class="ws-feature-card__icon" style="width: 80px; height: 80px;">
        <h4 class="ws-feature-card__title">Reishi</h4>
        <p class="ws-feature-card__text">Promotes calm and relaxation. The "queen of mushrooms" for stress support.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="ws-feature-card">
        <img src="{{ 'mushroom-cordyceps.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Cordyceps Mushroom" class="ws-feature-card__icon" style="width: 80px; height: 80px;">
        <h4 class="ws-feature-card__title">Cordyceps</h4>
        <p class="ws-feature-card__text">Supports natural energy and endurance. The athlete's choice for performance.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


{%- comment -%}
=====================================
SECTION 6: TRUST BADGES / FEATURES
=====================================
Use "Multicolumn" section
{%- endcomment -%}

<section class="ws-py-3xl" style="background: var(--ws-cream);">
  <div class="ws-container">
    <div class="ws-feature-grid" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);">
      <div class="ws-text-center">
        <div style="font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: var(--ws-space-sm);">🌿</div>
        <h4 style="font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: var(--ws-space-xs);">Organic</h4>
        <p style="font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--ws-medium-gray); margin: 0;">USDA Certified Organic ingredients</p>
      </div>

      <div class="ws-text-center">
        <div style="font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: var(--ws-space-sm);">🚫</div>
        <h4 style="font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: var(--ws-space-xs);">Non-GMO</h4>
        <p style="font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--ws-medium-gray); margin: 0;">No genetically modified ingredients</p>
      </div>

      <div class="ws-text-center">
        <div style="font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: var(--ws-space-sm);">0️⃣</div>
        <h4 style="font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: var(--ws-space-xs);">Zero Sugar</h4>
        <p style="font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--ws-medium-gray); margin: 0;">No added sugar, naturally sweetened</p>
      </div>

      <div class="ws-text-center">
        <div style="font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: var(--ws-space-sm);">🔥</div>
        <h4 style="font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: var(--ws-space-xs);">10 Calories</h4>
        <p style="font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--ws-medium-gray); margin: 0;">Light and refreshing, guilt-free</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


{%- comment -%}
=====================================
SECTION 7: NEWSLETTER SIGNUP CTA
=====================================
Use "Newsletter" section or "Email Signup Banner"
{%- endcomment -%}

<section class="ws-section-dark ws-py-4xl ws-text-center">
  <div class="ws-container">
    <h2 class="ws-mb-md">Join the Wander State Community</h2>
    <p class="ws-mb-xl" style="max-width: 600px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; opacity: 0.9;">
      Be the first to know about new flavors, exclusive offers, and outdoor adventures.
    </p>

    {% form 'customer', class: 'newsletter-form' %}
      <div style="display: flex; gap: var(--ws-space-sm); max-width: 500px; margin: 0 auto; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center;">
        <input type="email" name="contact[email]" placeholder="Enter your email" required style="flex: 1; min-width: 250px; padding: 0.875rem 1rem; border-radius: var(--ws-radius-md); border: none;">
        <button type="submit" class="button button--secondary">Subscribe</button>
      </div>
    {% endform %}

    <p style="font-size: 0.75rem; opacity: 0.6; margin-top: var(--ws-space-md);">
      We respect your privacy. Unsubscribe anytime.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>


{%- comment -%}
